Install the packages listed in live_requirements.txt. Set `VOICE_LAB_TOKEN` to a new local secret, then run `python -m uvicorn voice_gateway:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8092`. Open http://127.0.0.1:8092/ and enter that token. In the default echo mode, connect and capture microphone audio; hearing the echo establishes PCM transport only. Inspect bounded playback and Stop behavior. Reject a wrong token and disallowed origin.

